{My first game for Wimbledon Chess Club. I left Charterhouse in December 1967
and spent 6 months working at the Phoenix Assurance Company as a trainee
actuary in the pensions quotations section before going up to University
College Oxford in October 1968.} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 exd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5.
Nc3 c6 6. Bd3 Qa5 7. Bd2 Qb4 8. Nb3 Qb6 9. Qe2 Bg4 10. f3 Be6 11. Be3 Qc7 12.
