1. g3 Nf6 2. Bg2 g6 3. Nf3 Bg7 4. O-O O-O 5. c4 c6 6. Qc2 d6 7. Nc3 e5 8. d3
Nbd7 9. Rb1 Re8 10. Nd2 Nf8 11. b4 Ne6 12. Nb3 Nh5 13. b5 c5 14. Nd5 Nc7 15.
Bd2 Nxd5 16. Bxd5 Rb8 17. a4 Kh8 $4 ({A hallucination! I wanted to break the
pin to allow f5, but forgot he could just take the f-pawn!} 17... Bg4 {is equal
}) 18. Bxf7 Rf8 19. Bd5 Bh3 20. Bg2 Bxg2 21. Kxg2 Nf4+ $6 {If I just played
normally, he'd sit on the pawn-plus and wait for adjudication.} 22. gxf4 Qh4
23. f3 Rf5 24. Rh1 exf4 25. Rbg1 Re8 26. Bc3 Re3 27. Bxg7+ Kxg7 28. Nc1 h5 29.
Qb2+ Kf7 30. Kf1 Rfe5 {We agreed a draw, but actually white is winning!}
1/2-1/2

