{First game of the 1969-70 season. According to my notebook calculations, my
new grade was 180.} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 5. a3 Bxc3+ 6. bxc3
Qc7 7. Qg4 f5 8. Qg3 cxd4 9. cxd4 Kf8 $2 ({Uhlmann in ECO pp72-74 gives} 9...
Ne7 10. Bd2 O-O 11. Bd3 b6 12. Ne2 Ba6 13. Nf4 Qd7 14. Bb4 ({Psakhis pp152-153
prefers} 14. Bxa6 Nxa6 15. Qd3 Nb8 16. h4 {Kasparov,G (2795)-Short,N (2690)/
Novgorod 1997 (4)/1-0}) 14... Rf7 {Hort,V-Petrosian,T/ EU-chT (Men) 04th 1970 
(1.1)/0-1}) 10. Bd2 Nc6 11. Nf3 Nge7 12. Bd3 Bd7 13. O-O Rc8 14. h4 Qd8 15. h5
Qe8 16. Qh4 Rc7 $2 17. h6 g6 $4 (17... Qg6 18. hxg7+ Kxg7 19. g3 Ng8 20. Kg2
Qg4 21. Rh1 h6 22. Rab1 b6 23. Bf4 Qxh4 24. Rxh4) 18. Qf6+ Qf7 19. Qxh8+ Ng8
20. Ng5 Qe8 21. Qg7# 1-0

