1. c4 Nf6 2. d4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. Be2 O-O 6. g4 $6 c5 7. d5 e6 8. g5
Ne8 9. h4 Nc7 10. Be3 exd5 11. exd5 a6 ({Too slow. I should have played} 11...
b5 12. cxb5 Bb7 13. Bf3 Nd7 {aiming for quick development and attacking
white's centre}) 12. h5 Bd7 13. a4 Bf5 14. Qd2 Nd7 15. Nf3 Ne5 16. Nxe5 Bxe5
17. Bd3 Bg4 (17... Bxd3 $142 18. Qxd3 b5 19. O-O-O bxc4 20. Qxc4 Qd7 {with
some advantage. White can't threaten anything easily on the king's side e.g.}
21. hxg6 fxg6 {stops any white play on the h-file.}) 18. Be2 Bf5 19. Bd3 Bg4
20. Be2 Bf5 {draw by repetition} 1/2-1/2

