1. e4 Nf6 2. e5 Nd5 3. d4 d6 4. c4 Nb6 5. f4 dxe5 6. fxe5 Nc6 7. Be3 Bf5 8. Nc3
e6 9. Nf3 Be7 10. d5 exd5 11. cxd5 Nb4 12. Nd4 Bg6 ({See Eales and Williams
pp22-24. The critical line is} 12... Bd7 13. e6 fxe6 14. dxe6 Bc6 15. Qg4 Bh4+
16. g3 Bxh1 17. O-O-O {Williams,A-Cafferty,B (2440)/ BCF-ch Blackpool 1971 (10)
/1-0 e.g.}) 13. Bb5+ c6 ({White has a huge plus score against} 13... Kf8 14.
O-O Kg8 {Ovetchkin,R (2558)-Shutukov,S (2360)/ Sukhumi op 2008 (9)/1/2-1/2
although the highest rated game in the database is a draw.}) 14. dxc6 O-O 15.
cxb7 Rb8 16. Nc6 $2 (16. a3 N6d5 (16... N4d5 17. Nc6 {Strenzwilk,D-Gauntt,R/
USA-72ch Ventura 1971 (2)/1-0}) 17. Bf2 Nxc3 18. bxc3 {wins}) 16... Nxc6 17.
Bxc6 Qc7 18. Qf3 Qxe5 $2 ({The only game on the database goes} 18... Nc4 {
Serra Olives,T (2114)-Zoltek,T (2223)/Calvia Veterans op 4th 2007 (2)/0-1}) 19.
O-O Bc5 20. Nd5 $2 (20. Bf2 $142) 20... Bxe3+ (20... Be4 21. Ne7+ Qxe7 22. Bxe4
f5 23. Bd5+ Kh8 24. Bf2 Nxd5 25. Qxd5 Bxf2+ 26. Rxf2 Qxb7 $11) 21. Qxe3 Qxe3+
22. Nxe3 Bd3 23. a4 Bxf1 24. Kxf1 Nd7 25. Bxd7 Rxb7 26. Bb5 a6 27. Bxa6 Rxb2
28. Rc1 Ra2 29. Bb5 g6 30. Rc2 Ra3 31. Nc4 Ra1+ 32. Kf2 Kg7 33. Rd2 {The game
was adjourned here in a winning position for me, but we agreed a draw as I was
going back to Oxford.} 1/2-1/2

