1. c4 Nf6 2. Nc3 g6 3. e4 d6 4. d4 Bg7 5. f3 e5 6. d5 O-O 7. Bg5 h6 8. Be3 {
the odd move order (5...e5; before castling and 7.Bg5) has got us out of the
books.} c6 9. Qd2 cxd5 10. cxd5 Ne8 11. O-O-O Kh7 12. Bd3 Na6 13. g4 Bd7 14.
Kb1 Qa5 15. h4 Nec7 16. Nh3 f6 17. Rdg1 b5 18. f4 b4 19. Nd1 Bb5 20. Bxb5 $2
Nxb5 21. f5 Rab8 22. Ka1 Qa4 $2 23. b3 Qa3 24. g5 fxg5 25. hxg5 gxf5 26. gxh6
Bf6 27. Nb2 Rbc8 28. Nc4 Rxc4 29. bxc4 Nd4 30. Bxd4 exd4 31. Ng5+ $2 Bxg5 32.
Rxg5 Qc3+ $2 33. Qxc3 bxc3 34. Rg7+ Kh8 35. e5 $2 dxe5 36. Rhg1 Rb8 $2 37. h7
d3 $4 (37... c2 38. Rg8+ Kxh7 39. R8g7+ Kh6 40. R7g6+ Kh7 41. Rxa6 d3 42. Ra3 (
42. Rxa7+ Kh6 43. Ra6+ Kh5 44. Ra3 e4 45. d6 f4 46. Ra5+ Kh6 47. Rd5) 42... e4
{might still draw}) 38. d6 d2 39. Rg8+ (39. Rg8+ {and black resigned. It's
mate in} Kxh7 40. R8g3 Rb1+ 41. Rxb1 d1=Q 42. Rxd1 Nb4 43. Rh1#) 1-0

