{Bird's Defence has always been my main reply to the Ruy Lopez and over the
years I have had good results with it, although it needed some serious
remedial work after a loss to Craig Pritchett, who utilised some opening
theory from Chess Archives.} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 Nd4 4. Nxd4 exd4 5. c3
c6 6. Bc4 Nf6 7. Qe2 Bc5 8. e5 O-O 9. O-O d5 10. exf6 Re8 11. Qh5 g6 12. Qg5 h6
