{1974-5 was a bad season. My grade dropped to 189.} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4
cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 g6 6. f4 Nc6 7. Nxc6 bxc6 8. e5 Nd7 9. exd6 exd6 10.
Be3 Be7 11. Qf3 (11. Qd2 $142 O-O 12. O-O-O {Weinstein,N (2465) -Robatsch,K 
(2455)/Lone Pine op 1975 (9)/1-0 e.g.}) 11... d5 12. O-O-O O-O $146 {At the
time I thought this was a novelty but the database has one earlier game in 1974
} (12... Nf6 13. h3 {Kaplan,J-Mednis,E/Los Angeles 1974 (5)/1/2-1/2}) 13. g4
Bf6 14. Bd4 ({Rybka suggests} 14. Bf2 Qa5 15. a3 Nc5 16. Bd4 Bxd4 17. Rxd4)
14... Rb8 (14... Bxd4 15. Rxd4 Rb8 {Tarjan,J-Timman,J/Venice 1974 (2)/0-1}) 15.
Bxf6 Nxf6 16. f5 Qb6 17. b3 Qb4 18. g5 ({Rybka suggests} 18. h3 a5 19. Be2 a4
20. Rhf1 axb3 21. cxb3 {but black looks better.}) 18... Ne4 19. Nxe4 dxe4 20.
Qe3 Bxf5 21. Bc4 Qa3+ 22. Kb1 Rb4 (22... a5 23. Rd4 a4 24. Rhd1 axb3 (24... Ra8
25. R1d2) 25. cxb3 Qa7 26. h4 Rb7 27. a4 Rd7 28. Kb2) 23. Qc3 Ra4 24. Qb2 Qxb2+
25. Kxb2 Rb8 26. Be2 e3 27. c4 Ra5 28. Rhg1 Re8 29. Rd6 Be4 30. Rg3 Rf5 31. h4
$2 (31. Rxe3 Rxg5 32. Bf3 Rge5 33. Bxe4 Rxe4 34. Rxe4 Rxe4 35. Rxc6 $11) 31...
Bh1 {Draw agreed, although black has the advantage and maybe should have
continued.} 1/2-1/2

