1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nc3 c5 4. dxc5 Qa5 5. Bd2 Qxc5 6. Nf3 (6. Nd5 $142 $1 {
1/2-1/2}) 6... Qc7 7. Be2 Nf6 8. O-O O-O 9. Bg5 Nc6 10. h3 b6 11. Nd5 Qd8 12.
Nxf6+ Bxf6 13. Bxf6 exf6 14. Bc4 Qe7 15. Re1 Bb7 16. Bd5 Rab8 17. Qd2 Kg7 18.
Rad1 Rfe8 19. c3 h6 20. Re3 Ne5 21. Nxe5 fxe5 22. Bxb7 Rxb7 23. Rd3 Rd8 24. Rd6
Rc7 25. Qd3 Qh4 26. Qd5 Qe7 27. Rd3 h5 28. g3 f6 29. b4 Kh6 30. Rf3 Rf8 31. a4
Kg7 32. Rd3 Rd8 33. a5 bxa5 34. Qxa5 Rdc8 35. Qd5 Kh6 {Adjudicated a win for
white.} ({Rybka thinks that black can create drawing chances with} 35... Qf7
36. Qb5 Qc4 37. Qxc4 (37. Rxd7+ Kh6 38. Qxc4 {transposes}) 37... Rxc4 38. Rxd7+
Kh6 39. Rxa7 Rxc3 40. Rdd7 Rh8 41. b5 h4 $1 42. gxh4 Rxh3 43. b6 Rxh4 44. Rh7+
Kg5 45. Rxh4 Kxh4 46. Rg7 Kg5 47. b7 f5 48. exf5 Kxf5) (35... Kh6 {After} 36.
Rf3 Rf8 37. c4 Kg7 38. c5 Qe8 39. h4 Qe7 40. Kg2 Rf7 ({if} 40... Qe8 41. Rdxf6
Rxf6 42. Rxf6 Rxc5 43. Rxg6+ Qxg6 44. bxc5 Qe8 45. Qb7 {white is winning
another pawn, with a won endgame}) 41. b5 Qf8 42. b6 axb6 43. cxb6 Rc6 44. Rxc6
dxc6 45. Qxc6 {wins}) 1-0

