1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 b5 5. Nc3 Bb7 6. Bd3 Qc7 7. O-O e6 8. Re1
Bd6 ({This is Michael Franklin's preferred treatment, approved by Rybka!} 8...
Nc6 9. Nxc6 Qxc6 {gets into a sort of Taimanov but where white has attacking
threats e.g.} 10. a4 b4 11. Nd5 {Tal,M-Gipslis,A/URS-ch25 Riga 1958/1-0}) (8...
Nf6 9. e5 Nd5 {Linton,W-Sugden,J/BCF-ch Blackpool 1971 (7)/1-0}) 9. Bxb5 $6 (9.
Nf3 $142 $5 $14 {and if} Nc6 10. Bxb5) ({Apparently Michael had seen} 9. Qh5
Nc6 (9... Nf6 10. Qh4 {Nikitin,A-Shofman,M/URS-chT Moscow 1966/1-0}) 10. Nxc6
Qxc6 11. Qg5 {in a previous game}) 9... Bxh2+ 10. Kh1 Be5 11. f4 $2 (11. Be3)
11... Bxd4 $2 (11... Bxf4 $142 12. Ba4 Bg3 $17) 12. Qxd4 $11 axb5 $4 (12... Nf6
$142 13. Bd3 Nc6 $11) 13. Qxg7 $18 Qd8 14. Be3 {Michael had missed this.} Qf6
15. Bd4 Qxg7 16. Bxg7 Bc6 17. Bxh8 f6 18. e5 f5 19. a4 $1 b4 20. Nb5 Na6 21.
Nd6+ Kf8 22. Bf6 Nc7 23. Bh4 Nd5 24. Rf1 Ne3 25. Rf2 Nh6 26. Re2 Nd5 27. Be1
Nxf4 28. Rf2 Nd5 29. Bd2 Ng4 30. Re2 Rxa4 31. Rxa4 Bxa4 32. b3 Bc6 33. Nc4 Bb5
34. Kg1 Kg7 35. Re1 Kg6 36. Nb2 f4 $14 37. Nd3 Bxd3 38. cxd3 Kf5 39. d4 Nde3
40. g3 Nc2 $2 (40... h5 $142 $11) 41. Rf1 Nxd4 42. gxf4 $2 (42. Rxf4+ $142 Kxe5
43. Rxg4 Nf3+ 44. Kg2 Nxd2 45. Rxb4 $16) 42... Nxb3 43. Bxb4 1/2-1/2

